# VM PR policy

If `~/.config/agent-host/role` is `vm` or `homeserver`, or hostname is not `beto`:

- Do not commit to `main`/`master`
- Use branch `vm/<hostname>/<topic>`, push, `gh pr create --base main`

Session checkpoints: skill `session-handoff`. Cross-machine handoffs live in `.agent-sessions/CURRENT.md`.
